144
00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.840
So we were there all day.

145
00:06:43.840 --> 00:06:51.080
I remember at the end, Carell improvised, I don't think they used it on the show, but

146
00:06:51.080 --> 00:06:56.620
he went, thanks a lot, Christian, and tell your mother good luck with her leg, or something

147
00:06:56.620 --> 00:06:57.160
like that.

148
00:06:57.860 --> 00:07:01.640
Because I said my mother, like, during one of the improv things, I said my mother lost

149
00:07:01.640 --> 00:07:03.860
her leg, diabetes, or something like that.

150
00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:06.980
But I managed to push on through.

151
00:07:08.420 --> 00:07:11.960
And so during one of the improvs, when he was leaving, he goes, tell your mother good

152
00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:12.820
luck with her leg.

153
00:07:13.620 --> 00:07:14.420
You know what?

154
00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:18.680
We should remind folks that you and Steve had done Second City Together, right?

155
00:07:18.880 --> 00:07:19.500
In Chicago.

156
00:07:20.200 --> 00:07:24.020
And so you had definitely a shorthand with one another when it came to improv.

157
00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.340
