189
00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:02.260
That's right.

190
00:09:03.000 --> 00:09:04.080
Yeah, it was cool.

191
00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.020
Those guys are great.

192
00:09:05.160 --> 00:09:05.900
It was really great.

193
00:09:06.200 --> 00:09:06.820
Oh, man.

