203
00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:37.340
what would it be?

204
00:09:37.540 --> 00:09:40.100
Would it be the Kennedy Center improv show?

205
00:09:41.020 --> 00:09:41.420
Wow.

206
00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:43.220
Moment to go back and relive.

207
00:09:43.220 --> 00:09:47.640
I think the moment that I love, it has a bunch.

