214
00:10:14.440 --> 00:10:19.680
Paul Simon, Conan O'Brien, John Lovitz, Ralph Nader.

215
00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:26.680
And I was, I was this nerd from Chicago who would, you know, I didn't, it was insane to

216
00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:31.360
