1035
00:42:30.430 --> 00:42:31.530
get to pick the charities.

1036
00:42:31.890 --> 00:42:34.530
So she wants everyone to sort of make suggestions.

1037
00:42:34.950 --> 00:42:35.110
Yeah.

1038
00:42:35.510 --> 00:42:38.450
Stanley is going to suggest the American Diabetes Foundation.

1039
